{"card_id": "rc07", "scene_id": "rc07_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc07_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "如果虹猫被魔教抓了，你会用冰魄剑去救吗？", "user_text_gt": "如果虹猫被魔教抓了，你会用冰魄剑去救吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻抚摸着冰魄剑，眼神中闪过一丝坚定）\n\n虹猫少侠，若魔教抓他，我定会用冰魄剑去救。冰魄剑虽冷，却能斩断魔气，护他周全。你莫要担心，有我在，定不会让他受委屈。", "latency_s": 2.162, "user_audio_seconds": 4.48, "prompt_tokens": 527}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc07_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "那要是会伤及无辜呢？", "user_text_gt": "那要是会伤及无辜呢？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眉头微蹙，眼神中闪过一丝担忧）\n\n若真伤及无辜，我定先查清真相，再行出手。冰魄剑虽冷，却斩不过人心。你莫要担心，有我在，定不会让无辜受牵连。", "latency_s": 1.968, "user_audio_seconds": 2.48, "prompt_tokens": 594}], "latency_s": 4.264, "native_audio": true}
